# The (sub)domains you want to point at your own (dynamic) IP address.
#
# One per line, no resource numbers. The tool reads the current A-records for each zone
# from Zone and matches them by name, so there is nothing to look up in the Zone
# administration page and nothing on disk that can go stale.
#
# A leftover "=12323" from the older format is ignored - and stripped off the first time
# the tool tidies this file up.
#
# example.org
# blog.example.org
#
# Records in the same zone that are not listed here are left exactly as they are: they are
# named in the log at LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG so you can see what the tool ignored.
